ok   the page below the stack is not ours
ok   a stat of proc comes back whole
ok   its address is inside the kernel
ok   its size is the whole proc table
ok   it is readable and not writable
ok   kgetsym agrees with the stat
ok   the proc table reads back whole
ok   we are in it
ok   under our own uid
ok   with our own parent
